{"strongs": "H2134", "word": "זַךְ", "translit": "zakh", "root": "זול", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "pure, clean", "definition": "זַךְ adjective pure, clean ; absolute זַךְ Job 8:6 + 5 t.; זָךְ֛ Exod 27:20 ; Lev 24:2 feminine זַכָּה Exod 30:34 + 2 t.; — 1. literally, pure , i.e. unmixed, free from foreign substances, of olive oil Exod 27:20 ; Lev 24:2 , of frankincense Exod 30:34 ; Lev 24:7 (all P and H ). 2. figurative, pure, clean, righteous (only Job, Proverbs): — of man Job 8:6 (|| יָשָׁר ), Job 33:9 (+ בְּלִי פָ֑שַׁע ; || חַף ); as substantive = the pure, righteous וְזַךְ יָשָׁר פָּעֳלוֺ Prov 21:8 (opposed to וָזָר֑ q. v.); of mode of life כָּלדַּֿרְכֵיאִֿישׁ זַךְ בְּעֵינָיו Prov 16:2 of mode of action ( פָּעֳלוֺ ) Prov 20:11 (|| יָשָׁר ); of doctrine ( לִקְחִי ) Job 11:4 (|| בַּר הייתי ); of prayer Job 16:17 (|| לֹא חָמָס בְּכַפָּ֑י ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2351')\">BDB2351</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2134')\">H2134</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2350')\">BDB2350</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2352')\">BDB2352</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>זַךְ</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>pure, clean</highlightword>; absolute <bdbheb>זַךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 8:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,8,6)\">Job 8:6</ref> + 5 t.; <bdbheb>זָךְ֛</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 27:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,20)\">Exod 27:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 24:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,2)\">Lev 24:2</ref> feminine <bdbheb>זַכָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:34\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,34)\">Exod 30:34</ref> + 2 t.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> literally, <highlight>pure</highlight>, i.e. unmixed, free from foreign substances, of olive oil <ref ref=\"Exod 27:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,20)\">Exod 27:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 24:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,2)\">Lev 24:2</ref>, of frankincense <ref ref=\"Exod 30:34\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,34)\">Exod 30:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 24:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,7)\">Lev 24:7</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> and <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> figurative, <highlight>pure, clean, righteous</highlight> (only Job, Proverbs): — of man <ref ref=\"Job 8:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,8,6)\">Job 8:6</ref> (|| <bdbheb>יָשָׁר</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Job 33:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,9)\">Job 33:9</ref> (+ <bdbheb>בְּלִי פָ֑שַׁע</bdbheb>; || <bdbheb>חַף</bdbheb>); as substantive = <highlight>the pure, righteous</highlight> <bdbheb>וְזַךְ יָשָׁר פָּעֳלוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 21:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,8)\">Prov 21:8</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>וָזָר֑</bdbheb> q. v.); of mode of life <bdbheb>כָּלדַּֿרְכֵיאִֿישׁ זַךְ בְּעֵינָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 16:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,2)\">Prov 16:2</ref> of mode of action (<bdbheb>פָּעֳלוֺ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Prov 20:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,11)\">Prov 20:11</ref> (|| <bdbheb>יָשָׁר</bdbheb>); of doctrine (<bdbheb>לִקְחִי</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Job 11:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,11,4)\">Job 11:4</ref> (|| <bdbheb>בַּר הייתי</bdbheb>); of prayer <ref ref=\"Job 16:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,16,17)\">Job 16:17</ref> (|| <bdbheb>לֹא חָמָס בְּכַפָּ֑י</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Job 8:6", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 8, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Exod 27:20", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 27, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Lev 24:2", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 24, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Exod 30:34", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 30, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "Lev 24:7", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 24, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Job 33:9", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 33, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Prov 21:8", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 21, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Prov 16:2", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 16, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Prov 20:11", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 20, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Job 11:4", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 11, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Job 16:17", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 16, "verse": 17}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["זַךְ", "זָךְ֛", "זַכָּה", "יָשָׁר", "בְּלִי פָ֑שַׁע", "חַף", "וְזַךְ יָשָׁר פָּעֳלוֺ", "וָזָר֑", "כָּלדַּֿרְכֵיאִֿישׁ זַךְ בְּעֵינָיו", "פָּעֳלוֺ", "לִקְחִי", "בַּר הייתי", "לֹא חָמָס בְּכַפָּ֑י"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["H", "P"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB2351", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}